Available through the Stanford Center for
Professional Development.

00:54:46.460 --> 00:54:47.870
Class starts August 2nd.

00:54:47.870 --> 00:54:49.730
It's available entirely online.

00:54:49.730 --> 00:54:51.860
We hope you'll join us, and thanks again.

00:54:51.860 --> 00:54:52.873
Have a great rest of your day.

